# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.env

# The kit root ignores every `lib/` directory (a Python packaging pattern),
# which would silently drop src/lib from commits. Re-include it here.
!lib/

